          "quote": "Eric Schmidt, KBE, Chair and CEO of Relativity Space ... during his tenure as CEO and Chairman from 2001 to 2011. From 2018-2020, Eric served as the Technical Advisor to Alphabet. He was Executive Chairman of Alphabet from 2015-2018 and remained Chairman of Google until 2015. Prior to Google, Eric was Chairman and CEO of Novell. He spent 14 years at Sun Microsystems, rising to Chief Technology Officer. Since 2022 he has served as Chairman of Sandbox AQ. In 2021, he launched, and currently Chairs, the Special Competitive Studies Project. Eric holds a bachelor’s degree in electrical engineering from Princeton University and a master’s degree and Ph.D. in computer science from UC Berkeley.",
